Package: statebudgetmonitor
Title: Interactive Australian State and Territory Budget Monitor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Stephan", email = "david.stephan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible R pipeline that extracts forward estimates and
    historical actuals from every Australian state and territory Budget
    Paper, Mid-Year Economic and Fiscal Outlook, and Final Budget
    Outcome, harmonises them against the ABS Government Finance
    Statistics chart of accounts, and renders an interactive Quarto
    dashboard deployed to GitHub Pages. Implements vintage-aware
    storage so historical forward-estimate revisions can be
    reconstructed at any past as-of date.
